---
title: SmartSchools Security and Authorization Boundaries
config:
  theme: neutral
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
---
flowchart LR
  subgraph TENANT[Organisation tenant boundary]
    org[Organisation]
    schoolA[School and campus A]
    schoolB[School and campus B]
    org --> schoolA
    org --> schoolB
  end

  user[Authenticated user] --> auth[Cognito authentication and MFA options]
  auth --> session[Server validates identity and active session]
  session --> policy[NestJS authorization policy]
  policy --> rbac[Staff RBAC<br/>role plus tenant/campus/class scope]
  policy --> relationship[Guardian relationship permissions<br/>per child and capability]
  rbac --> api[Authorized API operation]
  relationship --> api

  api --> context[Transaction-scoped tenant and campus context]
  context --> appCheck[Domain-level ownership and policy checks]
  appCheck --> db[(PostgreSQL tenant-scoped records)]
  db --> rls[Row-level security as defense in depth]
  rls --> result[Authorized result only]

  api --> object[Private S3 access broker]
  object --> signed[Short-lived URL after record authorization]

  api --> audit[Audit sensitive reads and changes]
  api --> queue[Scoped background job and event]
  queue --> worker[Worker re-validates tenant and event permissions]
  worker --> audit

  denied[Denied request<br/>No data returned; security event recorded]
  appCheck -. authorization failure .-> denied
  rls -. policy failure .-> denied

  childSafety[Child protection<br/>Verified family links · age-aware AI<br/>pickup verification · human review]
  childSafety -. applies to .-> relationship
  childSafety -. applies to .-> api
  childSafety -. applies to .-> audit
